Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:11:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] guest: verify sealed mounts before container creation

Match sealed descriptors to measured initdata before CDH unsealing and keep plaintext confined to private mounts. Roll back resources acquired by failed container creation while retaining ownership when cleanup must be retried.

Use upstream AA startup binding for initdata; no local runtime-measurement RPC or event encoder is required.

